Note: npm audit reports three high-severity vulnerabilities in axios via open-jsonrpc-provider via @0glabs/0g-ts-sdk. These are SSRF/CSRF/credential-leakage classes that require attacker-controlled URLs to exploit. This tool only calls hardcoded 0G testnet endpoints with no user-controlled URL input, so the vulnerabilities are not exploitable in our use. No upstream fix is available as of 2026-05-01. Re-audit when @0glabs/0g-ts-sdk releases a version with an updated open-jsonrpc-provider dependency.
